# .claude/shifts — shift working state

The `agentic-developer` skill writes every file here, keyed by shift id. The journal starts from
`genesis/docs/shifts/JOURNAL-TEMPLATE.md` and becomes the sprint result
(`genesis/docs/shifts/SPRINT-RESULT-TEMPLATE.md`) at close. The journal is never committed. A
sprint result meant to outlive the workspace is committed under
`genesis/docs/superpowers/sprints/`, and the shift's concluded plans are decomposed into living
surfaces, not parked here.

`covers: subtree` is a considered ownership claim with no edit-time rule. Every file is
tool-written in a fixed shape, so there is no recurring drift for a rule to catch. The root
`.gitignore` ignores this whole directory (`**/.claude/shifts/`), so a file meant to travel with
the repository, such as `.gitkeep` or this manifest, is added with `git add -f`.
